            "description_html": "<b> Don-Jo 3/8-24 Back to Back Glass Mount or Surface Mounting Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n3/8-24\" Back to back glass mount bolt, also used as Surface Mounting Bolt for offset door pulls made by Don-Jo when the door pull has a 1/2\" diameter hole to receive the head of this bolt.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: For door pulls with smaller 3/8\" diameter hole and 1/4-20 thread use <a href=\"/products/surface-mount-bolt-for-don-jo-pulls-don-jo-sm1-bolt\"><b>Don-Jo Type6 SM1-BOLT</a></b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DJO-Type #5 Bolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thread Length: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/8-24 Thread</li>\r\n<li>Head: 1/2\" (.500)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Zinc Plated</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold individually. (One Bolt)\r\n</p>",
